60'tan fazla \u015fablona sahip s\u00fcr\u00fckleyip b\u0131rakmal\u0131 e-posta edit\u00f6r\u00fc. Yay\u0131nlar, b\u00fcltenler ve \u00fcr\u00fcn g\u00fcncellemeleri g\u00f6nderin."],"New drop":["Yeni indirim"],"Cart back":["Sepet geri"],"Welcome":["Ho\u015f geldiniz"],"Automate your workflow":["\u0130\u015f ak\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 otomatikle\u015ftirin"],"Welcome series, abandoned carts, post-purchase follow-ups \u2014 running on autopilot.":["Ho\u015f geldin serisi, terkedilmi\u015f sepetler, sat\u0131n alma sonras\u0131 takipler \u2014 otomatik olarak \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor."],"Signup":["Kay\u0131t ol"],"Wait 3d":["3 g\u00fcn bekleyin"],"Offer":["Teklif"],"Built-in lightweight CRM":["Yerle\u015fik hafif CRM"],"Custom fields, tags, segments and a full activity timeline for every contact you collect.":["Toplad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z her ki\u015fi i\u00e7in \u00f6zel alanlar, etiketler, segmentler ve tam etkinlik zaman \u00e7izelgesi."],"E-commerce integration":["E-ticaret entegrasyonu"],"Seamlessly integrate with WooCommerce, SureCart, and Easy Digital Downloads for complete customer insights.":["Tam m\u00fc\u015fteri i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcleri i\u00e7in WooCommerce, SureCart ve Easy Digital Downloads ile sorunsuz entegre edin."],"Secure & GDPR-ready":["G\u00fcvenli ve GDPR haz\u0131r"],"OAuth-based auth, encrypted connections, double opt-in, and full consent management built in.":["OAuth tabanl\u0131 kimlik do\u011frulama, \u015fifreli ba\u011flant\u0131lar, \u00e7ift onay ve tam r\u0131za y\u00f6netimi yerle\u015fik."],"Authentication failed":["Kimlik do\u011frulama ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z oldu"],"Please try again. If the problem persists, contact support.":["L\u00fctfen tekrar deneyin. Sorun devam ederse, destek ile ileti\u015fime ge\u00e7in."],"Email marketing & CRM ":["E-posta pazarlama ve CRM "],"built for WordPress":["WordPress i\u00e7in haz\u0131r"],"Turn your WordPress visitors into customers. Capture leads with forms, sync contacts in real-time, and send beautiful campaigns \u2014 all without leaving your dashboard.":["WordPress ziyaret\u00e7ilerinizi m\u00fc\u015fterilere d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr\u00fcn. Formlarla potansiyel m\u00fc\u015fteri yakalay\u0131n, ki\u015fileri ger\u00e7ek zamanl\u0131 senkronize edin ve g\u00fczel kampanyalar g\u00f6nderin \u2014 hepsini kontrol panelinizi terk etmeden."],"Already have an account?":["Zaten bir hesab\u0131n\u0131z var m\u0131?"],"Sign in":["Oturum a\u00e7"],"SureContact overview video":["SureContact genel bak\u0131\u015f videosu"],"Features":["\u00d6zellikler"],"What if email marketing was ":["E-posta pazarlama "],"actually easy":["ger\u00e7ekten kolay olsayd\u0131"],"?":["?"],"SureContact gives you everything you need to grow a list, send beautiful emails, and automate your follow-ups \u2014 natively inside WordPress.":["SureContact, bir liste olu\u015fturmak, g\u00fczel e-postalar g\u00f6ndermek ve takiplerinizi otomatikle\u015ftirmek i\u00e7in ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z olan her \u015feyi WordPress i\u00e7inde size sunar."],"Get started in minutes":["Dakikalar i\u00e7inde ba\u015flay\u0131n"],"How it works":["Nas\u0131l \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r"],"From plugin activation to your first campaign \u2014 three steps, no friction.":["Eklenti etkinle\u015ftirmeden ilk kampanyan\u0131za \u2014 \u00fc\u00e7 ad\u0131m, s\u00fcrt\u00fcnme yok."],"Confirm your details":["Bilgilerinizi onaylay\u0131n"],"Your name, email, and site URL are auto-filled from WordPress. Just confirm and continue \u2014 no signup form to fight with.":["Ad\u0131n\u0131z, e-posta adresiniz ve site URL'niz WordPress'ten otomatik olarak doldurulur. Sadece onaylay\u0131n ve devam edin \u2014 m\u00fccadele edece\u011finiz bir kay\u0131t formu yok."],"Sync your contacts":["Ki\u015filerinizi senkronize edin"],"SureContact pulls in existing WP users, WooCommerce customers, and form submissions automatically. Two-way sync keeps everything fresh.":["SureContact, mevcut WP kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131, WooCommerce m\u00fc\u015fterilerini ve form g\u00f6nderimlerini otomatik olarak al\u0131r. \u0130ki y\u00f6nl\u00fc senkronizasyon her \u015feyi g\u00fcncel tutar."],"Send your first campaign":["\u0130lk kampanyan\u0131z\u0131 g\u00f6nderin"],"Pick a template, drag in a few blocks, hit send. Or set up a welcome automation that runs while you sleep.":["Bir \u015fablon se\u00e7in, birka\u00e7 blok s\u00fcr\u00fckleyin, g\u00f6nder butonuna t\u0131klay\u0131n. Ya da uyurken \u00e7al\u0131\u015fan bir ho\u015f geldin otomasyonu kurun."],"Integrations":["Entegrasyonlar"],"SureContact ":["SureContact "],"already works":["zaten \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor"]," with your favorite WordPress plugins":[" favori WordPress eklentilerinizle"],"Connect once. Sync everything. Out-of-the-box integrations with every major form, commerce, and theme plugin in the WordPress ecosystem.":["Bir kez ba\u011flan\u0131n. Her \u015feyi senkronize edin. WordPress ekosistemindeki her b\u00fcy\u00fck form, ticaret ve tema eklentisi ile kutudan \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131\u011f\u0131 gibi entegrasyonlar."],"+ %d more native integrations":["+ %d daha yerel entegrasyon"],"Testimonials":["Referanslar"],"Trusted by WordPress teams worldwide":["D\u00fcnyada WordPress ekipleri taraf\u0131ndan g\u00fcvenilir"],"Over 12M+ sites use Brainstorm Force plugins to ship faster.":["12M+ web sitesi Brainstorm Force eklentilerini daha h\u0131zl\u0131 yay\u0131nlamak i\u00e7in kullan\u0131yor."],"SureContact User":["SureContact Kullan\u0131c\u0131s\u0131"],"SureContact is on another level. I love that the heavy lifting happens outside WordPress, and the connector syncing multiple sites into one dashboard is exactly what I needed. I\u2019ve finally ditched MailerLite.":["SureContact ba\u015fka bir seviyede. A\u011f\u0131r y\u00fck\u00fcn WordPress d\u0131\u015f\u0131ndaki i\u015flemlerle yap\u0131lmas\u0131 ho\u015fuma gidiyor ve birden fazla siteyi tek bir kontrol paneline senkronize eden ba\u011flant\u0131 tam olarak ihtiyac\u0131m olan \u015feydi. Nihayet MailerLite'dan kurtuldum."],"Founder, Hillman Academy":["Kurucu, Hillman Academy"],"You guys are the GOAT! The speed of implementation is unchallenged to any other software provider I\u2019ve ever used. Simply Amazing! Thanks, I\u2019ll get started with setting everything up using Mailersend now.":["Sizler en iyisiniz! Uygulama h\u0131z\u0131, kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131m herhangi bir di\u011fer yaz\u0131l\u0131m sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131s\u0131na kar\u015f\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lamaz. Sadece harika! Te\u015fekk\u00fcrler, \u015fimdi Mailersend kullanarak her \u015feyi kurmaya ba\u015flayaca\u011f\u0131m."],"Founder, EDITO Sarl":["Kurucu, EDITO Sarl"],"Incredibly fast and responsive support. List-Unsubscribe and List-Unsubscribe-Post headers were implemented immediately, and everything worked perfectly in testing.":["Son derece h\u0131zl\u0131 ve duyarl\u0131 destek. List-Unsubscribe ve List-Unsubscribe-Post ba\u015fl\u0131klar\u0131 hemen uyguland\u0131 ve her \u015fey testte m\u00fckemmel \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131."],"SureContact\u2019s connector-based implementation is way better than MailerPress. No comparison.":["SureContact'\u0131n ba\u011flant\u0131 tabanl\u0131 uygulamas\u0131 MailerPress'ten \u00e7ok daha iyi. Kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lamaz."],"Demo Queen":["Demo Krali\u00e7esi"],"I expected SureContact to be a nice-to-have. 67 minutes later, I loved it. It feels like OttoKit\u2019s answer to email.":["SureContact'in nice-to-have olmas\u0131n\u0131 bekliyordum. 67 dakika sonra, ona bay\u0131ld\u0131m. OttoKit'in email i\u00e7in yan\u0131t\u0131 gibi hissediyor."],"Does exactly what it promises. The focus is squarely on conversion and user experience. The team behind the plugin consistently proves they understand entrepreneurial needs, and their support is top-tier.":["Tam olarak vaat etti\u011fini yap\u0131yor. Odak noktas\u0131 tamamen d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f\u00fcm ve kullan\u0131c\u0131 deneyimi \u00fczerine. Eklentinin arkas\u0131ndaki ekip, giri\u015fimci ihtiya\u00e7lar\u0131n\u0131 anlad\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 s\u00fcrekli kan\u0131tl\u0131yor ve destekleri \u00fcst d\u00fczey."],"Trusted by 12M+ businesses":["12M+ i\u015fletme taraf\u0131ndan g\u00fcvenilir"],"Ready to grow your list?":["Listenizi b\u00fcy\u00fctmeye haz\u0131r m\u0131s\u0131n\u0131z?"],"Join 12M+ WordPress sites already using SureContact to capture, nurture, and convert their visitors.":["Ziyaret\u00e7ilerini yakalamak, beslemek ve d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrmek i\u00e7in zaten SureContact kullanan 12M+ WordPress sitesine kat\u0131l\u0131n."],"Get started":["Ba\u015flay\u0131n"],"Select an option":["Bir se\u00e7enek se\u00e7in"],"Select lists\u2026":["Listeleri se\u00e7in\u2026"],"Select tags\u2026":["Etiketleri se\u00e7in\u2026"],"Add":["Ekle"],"No items added yet. Click \"Add\" to create your first entry.":["Hen\u00fcz hi\u00e7bir \u00f6\u011fe eklenmedi. \u0130lk kayd\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 olu\u015fturmak i\u00e7in \"Ekle\"ye t\u0131klay\u0131n."],"Item %d":["\u00d6\u011fe %d"],"Remove item":["\u00d6\u011feyi kald\u0131r"],"%1$s for item %2$d":["%1$s \u00f6\u011fesi i\u00e7in %2$d"],"No form fields available to map":["E\u015fle\u015ftirilecek form alan\u0131 yok"],"Form Field":["Form Alan\u0131"],"CRM Field":["CRM Alan\u0131"],"Select CRM field for %s":["%s i\u00e7in CRM alan\u0131 se\u00e7in"],"No configuration required.":["Konfig\u00fcrasyon gerekmiyor."],"Text":["Metin"],"Number":["Numara"],"Date":["Tarih"],"Timestamp":["Zaman Damgas\u0131"],"URL":["URL"],"Dropdown":["A\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r Men\u00fc"],"Multi-Select":["\u00c7oklu Se\u00e7im"],"Checkbox":["Onay Kutusu"],"Text Area":["Metin Alan\u0131"],"Field slug is required.":["Alan slug'\u0131 gereklidir."],"Slug can only contain lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores.":["Slug yaln\u0131zca k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck harfler, rakamlar ve alt \u00e7izgiler i\u00e7erebilir."],"At least one option is required.":["En az bir se\u00e7enek gereklidir."],"Field Label":["Alan Etiketi"],"e.g., Company Size":["\u00d6rn., \u015eirket B\u00fcy\u00fckl\u00fc\u011f\u00fc"],"Field Slug":["Alan Slug'\u0131"],"e.g., company_size":["\u00d6rn., sirket_boyutu"],"Unique identifier for this field. Only lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores.":["Bu alan i\u00e7in benzersiz tan\u0131mlay\u0131c\u0131. Sadece k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck harfler, rakamlar ve alt \u00e7izgiler."],"Field Type":["Alan T\u00fcr\u00fc"],"Required Field":["Zorunlu Alan"],"Make this field mandatory when creating contacts.":["Bu alan\u0131, ki\u015filer olu\u015ftururken zorunlu k\u0131l\u0131n."],"Mark field as required":["Alan\u0131 zorunlu olarak i\u015faretle"],"Options":["Se\u00e7enekler"],"Option":["Se\u00e7enek"],"Remove option":["Se\u00e7ene\u011fi kald\u0131r"],"Add Option":["Se\u00e7enek ekle"],"Cancel":["\u0130ptal"],"Creating\u2026":["Olu\u015fturuluyor\u2026"],"Create Field":["Alan Olu\u015ftur"],"Select Option":["Se\u00e7enek Se\u00e7"],"Search fields\u2026":["Alanlar\u0131 ara\u2026"],"Select CRM field":["CRM alan\u0131 se\u00e7in"],"Last sync: %s":["Son senkronizasyon: %s"],"Error syncing fields":["Alanlar\u0131 senkronize etme hatas\u0131"],"Contact Fields":["\u0130leti\u015fim Alanlar\u0131"],"Custom Fields":["\u00d6zel Alanlar"],"Loading\u2026":["Y\u00fckleniyor\u2026"],"No fields found for":["\u015eu i\u00e7in alan bulunamad\u0131"],"Create":["Olu\u015ftur"],"Create Custom Field":["\u00d6zel Alan Olu\u015ftur"],"Pull Custom Fields":["\u00d6zel Alanlar\u0131 \u00c7ek"],"Something went wrong":["Bir \u015feyler ters gitti"],"We're sorry, but something unexpected happened. Please try refreshing the page.":["\u00dczg\u00fcn\u00fcz, ama beklenmedik bir durum ya\u015fand\u0131. L\u00fctfen sayfay\u0131 yenilemeyi deneyin."],"Try Again":["Tekrar deneyin"],"Reload Page":["Sayfay\u0131 yenile"],"Error Details (Development Mode)":["Hata Ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131 (Geli\u015ftirme Modu)"],"Error:":["Hata:"],