ror saving mappings":["Haritalar\u0131 kaydederken hata"],"Field \"%s\" is now available.":["Alan \"%s\" art\u0131k kullan\u0131labilir."],"Error creating custom field":["\u00d6zel alan olu\u015ftururken hata"],"%s field mappings":["%s alan haritalar\u0131"],"WordPress Field":["WordPress Alan\u0131"],"Type":["T\u00fcr"],"SureContact Field":["SureContact Alan\u0131"],"Sync":["Senkronizasyon"],"Error Loading Data":["Veri Y\u00fckleme Hatas\u0131"],"Failed to load field mapping data. Please refresh the page and try again.":["Alan haritalama verileri y\u00fcklenemedi. L\u00fctfen sayfay\u0131 yenileyin ve tekrar deneyin."],"Disconnect failed":["Ba\u011flant\u0131 kesme ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z"],"Disconnected":["Ba\u011flant\u0131 kesildi"],"You have been disconnected.":["Ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131z kesildi."],"Disconnect Failed":["Ba\u011flant\u0131 Kesme Ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z"],"Unable to disconnect":["Ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 kesmek m\u00fcmk\u00fcn de\u011fil"],"VIP Support":["VIP Destek"],"Help Center":["Yard\u0131m Merkezi"],"Join the Community":["Toplulu\u011fa Kat\u0131l"],"Rate Us":["Bizi De\u011ferlendir"],"Welcome to SureContact":["SureContact'a Ho\u015f Geldiniz"],"SureContact is a comprehensive CRM platform that helps you manage customer relationships and data effectively. Connect your WordPress site to centralize customer information, track interactions, and streamline your business operations.":["SureContact, m\u00fc\u015fteri ili\u015fkilerini ve verilerini etkili bir \u015fekilde y\u00f6netmenize yard\u0131mc\u0131 olan kapsaml\u0131 bir CRM platformudur. M\u00fc\u015fteri bilgilerini merkezile\u015ftirmek, etkile\u015fimleri takip etmek ve i\u015f operasyonlar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 kolayla\u015ft\u0131rmak i\u00e7in WordPress sitenizi ba\u011flay\u0131n."],"By visiting the CRM, you will be able to see all synced contacts and manage tags, lists, and custom fields. You can create beautiful campaigns and automations, along with many other features. Excited to get started? Please click the button below.":["CRM'yi ziyaret ederek, t\u00fcm senkronize edilmi\u015f ki\u015fileri g\u00f6rebilir ve etiketler, listeler ve \u00f6zel alanlar\u0131 y\u00f6netebilirsiniz. G\u00fczel kampanyalar ve otomasyonlar olu\u015fturabilir, bir\u00e7ok ba\u015fka \u00f6zellik ile birlikte. Ba\u015flamaya heyecanl\u0131 m\u0131s\u0131n\u0131z? L\u00fctfen a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki butona t\u0131klay\u0131n."],"Visit CRM":["CRM'yi Ziyaret Et"],"Read Full Guide":["Tam K\u0131lavuzu Oku"],"Watch SureContact overview video":["SureContact genel video izle"],"Connection Status":["Ba\u011flant\u0131 Durumu"],"Your site is connected to SureContact":["Siteniz SureContact'a ba\u011fl\u0131"],"Connected":["Ba\u011fl\u0131"],"Disconnect":["Ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 Kes"],"Quick Access":["H\u0131zl\u0131 Eri\u015fim"],"Disconnect from SureContact?":["SureContact'tan ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 kesmek istiyor musunuz?"],"This will remove authentication and cached SureContact data from WordPress. You can reconnect anytime.":["Bu, WordPress'ten kimlik do\u011frulamas\u0131n\u0131 ve \u00f6nbelle\u011fe al\u0131nm\u0131\u015f SureContact verilerini kald\u0131racakt\u0131r. \u0130stedi\u011finiz zaman yeniden ba\u011flanabilirsiniz."],"Are you sure you want to disconnect your WordPress site from SureContact? This action will remove all cached data and authentication tokens.":["SureContact'tan WordPress sitenizin ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kesmek istedi\u011finize emin misiniz? Bu i\u015flem, t\u00fcm \u00f6nbelle\u011fe al\u0131nm\u0131\u015f verileri ve kimlik do\u011frulama jetonlar\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131racakt\u0131r."],"Disconnecting\u2026":["Ba\u011flant\u0131 Kesiliyor\u2026"],"Important Note:":["\u00d6nemli Not:"],"Make sure to go to the Contact Fields tab first, match your plugin fields with the corresponding CRM fields, and mark them as Active. After completing this step, return here and then enable the additional settings below. If you do not complete this step, the settings below will not work as expected, and your contacts will not sync with the SureContact CRM.":["\u00d6ncelikle \u0130leti\u015fim Alanlar\u0131 sekmesine gidin, eklenti alanlar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 ilgili CRM alanlar\u0131yla e\u015fle\u015ftirin ve bunlar\u0131 Aktif olarak i\u015faretleyin. Bu ad\u0131m\u0131 tamamlad\u0131ktan sonra buraya geri d\u00f6n\u00fcn ve a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki ek ayarlar\u0131 etkinle\u015ftirin. Bu ad\u0131m\u0131 tamamlamazsan\u0131z, a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki ayarlar beklenildi\u011fi gibi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmayacak ve ki\u015filerinizi SureContact CRM ile senkronize edemeyeceksiniz."],"Plugin Integrations":["Eklenti Entegrasyonlar\u0131"],"Manage integrations with WordPress plugins to sync data to SureContact":["Verileri SureContact ile senkronize etmek i\u00e7in WordPress eklentileri ile entegrasyonlar\u0131 y\u00f6netin"],"Add Integration":["Entegrasyon Ekle"],"On %1$s of %2$s":["%1$s %2$s tarihinde"],"Select %s color":["%s rengini se\u00e7"],"Note color: %s. Click to change":["Not rengi: %s. De\u011fi\u015ftirmek i\u00e7in t\u0131klay\u0131n"],"Delete note":["Notu sil"],"Close":["Kapat"],"Add note here\u2026":["Buraya not ekleyin\u2026"],"Save":["Kaydet"],"Enabled":["Etkin"],"Disabled":["Devre D\u0131\u015f\u0131"],"Not Installed":["Y\u00fcklenmedi"],"Open documentation in new window":["Dok\u00fcmantasyonu yeni pencerede a\u00e7"],"Documentation":["Dok\u00fcmantasyon"],"%1$s %2$s integration":["%1$s %2$s entegrasyonu"],"Disable":["Devre D\u0131\u015f\u0131 B\u0131rak"],"Enable":["Etkinle\u015ftir"],"Hide settings":["Ayarlar\u0131 gizle"],"Show settings":["Ayarlar\u0131 g\u00f6ster"],"Failed to load integrations":["Entegrasyonlar\u0131 y\u00fckleme ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z oldu"],"Loading field mapping\u2026":["Alan e\u015flemesini y\u00fckl\u00fcyor\u2026"],"Plugin Field":["Eklenti Alan\u0131"],"---Skip---":["---Atla---"],"Select CRM field\u2026":["CRM alan\u0131n\u0131 se\u00e7\u2026"],"No fields 